 "name": "IRLML6401TRPBF",
 "kind": "mosfet",
 "manufacturer": "Infineon (International Rectifier)",
 "title": "-12 V P-channel HEXFET power MOSFET in Micro3 (SOT-23)",
 "source": {
  "revision": "April 28, 2014",
  "pages": 10
 },
 "summary": "A single P-channel HEXFET MOSFET in the three-lead Micro3 package, the SOT-23 outline with a large-pad leadframe for better heat flow and a height under 1.1 mm. It blocks -12 V and carries -4.3 A continuously at 25 °C ambient (-34 A pulsed). On-resistance is guaranteed at three gate drives down to -1.8 V: 50, 85 and 125 mΩ max at -4.5, -2.5 and -1.8 V. Intended for battery and load management in thin portable equipment. Lead-free, halogen-free, RoHS compliant, MSL1.",
